  FT["MY-H679"] = {"id":"MY-H679","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 100/2020&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年食品（修正）条例","en":"FOOD (AMENDEMENT) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"FOOD (AMENDEMENT) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Makanan (Pindaan) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Thực phẩm (Sửa đổi) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับอาหาร (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Pangan (Perubahan) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA100","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2020_P.U.(A)100-2020_FOOD (AMENDEMENT) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H679-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nMakanan (Pindaan) 2020.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 April 2020.\n\nPindaan peraturan 386a"}},{"id":"MY-H679-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Makanan 1985 [P.U. (A) 437/1985] dipinda dalam\n\nperaturan 386a—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perenggan (1)(a) dengan perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(a) hendaklah mengandungi etil alkohol daripada sulingan yang\n\nberasal daripada hasil pertanian;\";\nP.U. (A) 100. 866\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perenggan (1)(b) dengan perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(b) boleh mengandungi spirit sebagaimana yang ditetapkan dalam\n\nperaturan 377 atau etil alkohol daripada penapaian yang berasal\n\ndaripada hasil pertanian atau kedua-duanya;\";\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas subperaturan (1) subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(1a) Sebatian minuman keras boleh mengandungi bahan pemanis\n\nyang dibenarkan dan bahan perisa yang dibenarkan.\";\n\n(d) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"700\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"350\"; dan\n\n(e) dengan memotong subperaturan (5).\n\nDibuat 25 Mac 2020\n\n[KKM.600-1/1/35 JLD. 2(35); PN(PU2)418/XXVI]\n\n Dato' Sri Dr. Adham bin Baba\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nFOOD ACT 1983\n\nFood (Amendment) Regulations 2020\n\nIn exercise of the powers conferred by section 34 of the Food Act 1983\n\n[Act 281], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6790"] = {"id":"MY-H6790","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2014&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年限速（第二槟城大桥）（修正）令","en":"SPEED LIMIT (SECOND PENANG BRIDGE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014","orig":"SPEED LIMIT (SECOND PENANG BRIDGE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Had Laju (Jambatan Kedua Pulau Pinang) (Pindaan) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ (Cầu Penang thứ hai) (Sửa đổi) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็ว (สะพานปีนังแห่งที่ 2) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan (Jembatan Penang Kedua) (Perubahan) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)82-2014_SPEED LIMIT (SECOND PENANG BRIDGE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6790-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju\n\n(Jambatan Kedua Pulau Pinang) (Pindaan) 2014.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 April 2014.\n\nPindaan tajuk"}},{"id":"MY-H6790-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju (Jambatan Kedua Pulau Pinang) 2014 [P.U. (A) 52/2014], yang\n\ndisebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam tajuk dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"(JAMBATAN KEDUA PULAU PINANG)\" dengan perkataan\n\n\"(JAMBATAN SULTAN ABDUL HALIM MU'ADZAM SHAH)\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 1"}},{"id":"MY-H6790-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Subperenggan 1(1) Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"(Jambatan Kedua Pulau Pinang)\" dengan perkataan \"(Jambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah)\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H6790-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Jadual Pertama kepada Perintah ibu dipinda dalam ruang (1), dengan\n\nmenggantikan perkataan \"Jambatan Kedua Pulau Pinang\" dengan perkataan \"Jambatan\n\nSultan Abdul Halim Mu'adzam Shah\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H6790-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Jadual Kedua kepada Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan peta dengan\n\npeta yang berikut:\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n\"PETA JAMBATAN SULTAN ABDUL HALIM MU'ADZAM SHAH\n\nDibuat 28 Mac 2014\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/31; PN(PU2)460/LXXIV]\n\nDATUK HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nSELAT SELATAN\n\n\".\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nSPEED LIMIT (SECOND PENANG BRIDGE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(2) of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Speed Limit (Second Penang Bridge)\n\n(Amendment) Order 2014.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 April 2014.\n\nAmendment of title\n\n2. The Speed Limit (Second Penang Bridge) Order 2014 [P.U. (A) 52/2014], which\n\nis referred to as the \"principal Order\" in this Order, is amended in the title by\n\nsubstituting for the words \"(SECOND PENANG BRIDGE)\" the words\n\n\"(JAMBATAN SULTAN ABDUL HALIM MU'ADZAM SHAH)\".\n\nAmendment of paragraph 1\n\n3. Subparagraph 1(1) of the principal Order is amended by substituting for the\n\nwords \"(Second Penang Bridge)\" the words \"(Jambatan Sultan Abdul Halim\n\nMu'adzam Shah)\".\n\nAmendment of First Schedule\n\n4. The First Schedule to the principal Order is amended in column (1), by\n\nsubstituting for the words \"Second Penang Bridge\" the words \"Jambatan Sultan Abdul\n\nHalim Mu'adzam Shah\".\n\nAmendment of Second Schedule\n\n5. The Second Schedule to the principal Order is amended by substituting for the\n\nmap the following map:\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n\"MAP OF JAMBATAN SULTAN ABDUL HALIM MU'ADZAM SHAH\n\nMade 28 March 2014\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/7/31; PN(PU2)460/LXXIV]\n\nDATUK HAJI FADILLAH BIN HAJI YUSOF\n\nMinister of Works\n\nSOUTH CHANNEL\n\n\"."}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6791"] = {"id":"MY-H6791","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2015&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年可再生能源（附表修正）令","en":"RENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2015","orig":"RENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Tenaga Boleh Baharu (Pindaan Jadual) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Năng lượng tái tạo (Sửa đổi phụ lục) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งพลังงานหมุนเวียน (การแก้ไขภาคผนวก) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Energi Terbarukan (Perubahan Lampiran) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)82-2015_RENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6791-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Tenaga Boleh Baharu\n\n(Pindaan Jadual) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 6 Mei 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H6791-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual kepada Akta Tenaga Boleh Baharu 2011 dipinda dengan menggantikan\n\nbutiran \"Geoterma\" dan butiran lain yang berhubungan dengannya dengan butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\nRuang\n\nPertama\n\nRuang Kedua Ruang Ketiga Ruang\n\nKeempat\n\nRuang\n\nKelima\n\nSumber\n\nboleh\n\nbaharu\n\nPerihalan\n\npepasangan tenaga\n\nboleh baharu yang\n\nlayak\n\nKadar tarif\n\ngalakan (dalam\n\nringgit bagi\n\nsetiap kilowatt\n\njam)\n\nTempoh\n\nberkuat kuasa\n\n(bermula dari\n\ntarikh\n\npermulaan\n\nkuat kuasa\n\ntarif galakan)\n\nKadar\n\npengurangan\n\ntahunan\n\n\"Geoterma Pepasangan tenaga\n\nboleh baharu yang\n\nmempunyai kapasiti\n\nterpasang sehingga\n\ndan termasuk 30\n\nmegawatt\n\n0.45 21 tahun 0%\".\n\nDibuat 29 April 2015\n\n[KeTTHA: (S)100-1/1/5; PN(PU2)693/VII]\n\nDATUK SERI PANGLIMA DR. MAXIMUS JOHNITY ONGKILI\n\nMenteri Tenaga, Teknologi Hijau dan Air\n\nRENEWABLE ENERGY ACT 2011\n\nRENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 63 of the Renewable Energy\n\nAct 2011 [Act 725], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6792"] = {"id":"MY-H6792","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年金融服务（指定支付工具）（修正）令","en":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (DESIGNATED PAYMENT INSTRUMENTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016","orig":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (DESIGNATED PAYMENT INSTRUMENTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan (Instrumen Pembayaran Yang Ditentukan) (Pindaan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ tài chính (Các công cụ thanh toán được chỉ định) (Sửa đổi) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งบริการทางการเงิน (ตราสารการชำระเงินที่กำหนด) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Jasa Keuangan (Instrumen Pembayaran Tertentu) (Perubahan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2016_P.U.(A)82-2016_FINANCIAL SERVICES (DESIGNATED PAYMENT INSTRUMENTS) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6792-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah P erkhidmatan Kewangan\n(Instrumen Pembayaran yang Ditetapkan) (Pindaan) 2016.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H6792-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan (Instrumen Pembayaran yang Ditetapkan) 2013\n[P.U. (A) 202/2013 ] dipinda dalam subperenggan 2(c), dengan menggantikan perkataa n\n\"akaun deposit di sesuatu  institusi kewangan \" dengan perkataan \"akaun deposit,\nakaun semasa, akaun simpanan atau akaun lain yang serupa di suatu  institusi\nkewangan\".\n\nDibuat 17 Mac 2016\n[BNM/JUN/1125/50/01; PN(PU2)718/III]\n\nTAN SRI DATO' SRI DR. ZETI AKHTAR AZIZ\nGabenor\nBank Negara Malaysia\n\nDipersetujui 28 Mac 2016\n[KK/BPKA/K2/(8)/382/690/9/1 JLD 4 (S.K. II); PN(PU2)718/III]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES ACT 2013\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES (DESIGNATED PAYMENT INSTRUMENTS) (AMENDMENT)\nORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 31 of\nthe Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 758 ], the Bank , with the concurrence of\nthe Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6793"] = {"id":"MY-H6793","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第5号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 5) ORDER 2017","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 5) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 5) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 5) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 5) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 5) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)82-2017_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 5) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6793-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 5) 2017.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H6793-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam,\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai dan yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkepentingan awam adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nIsu Semasa\n\nDalam\n\nRisalah:\n\nKonsep\n\nKebebasan\n\ndan Agama\n\nAl-Mustaqeem\n\nMahmod Radhi\n\n(Editor)\n\nMiddle-Eastern Graduates\n\nCentre Sdn. Bhd. (MEGC)\n\ndengan kerjasama Konrad\n\nAdenauer Foundation\n\nNo. 14, Lorong Dungun,\n\nBukit Damansara,\n\n50490 Kuala Lumpur\n\nOne Touch Creative\n\nNo. 5-2, Jalan Seksyen\n\n3/9, Pusat Perniagaan\n\nKajang Utama, 43000\n\nKajang, Selangor\n\nMelayu\n\nDibuat 2 Mac 2017\n\n[KDN.PQ.S. 600-16/15/20; PN(PU2)417/XVIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 5) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the\n\nPrinting Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 5) Order 2017.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, likely to alarm public opinion and likely\n\nto be prejudicial to public interest is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor /\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\nIsu Semasa\n\nDalam Risalah:\n\nKonsep\n\nKebebasan dan\n\nAgama\n\nAl-Mustaqeem\n\nMahmod Radhi\n\n(Editor)\n\nMiddle-Eastern\n\nGraduates Centre Sdn.\n\nBhd. (MEGC) dengan\n\nkerjasama Konrad\n\nAdenauer Foundation\n\nNo. 14, Lorong Dungun,\n\nBukit Damansara,\n\n50490 Kuala Lumpur\n\nOne Touch\n\nCreative\n\nNo. 5-2, Jalan\n\nSeksyen 3/9, Pusat\n\nPerniagaan Kajang\n\nUtama, 43000\n\nKajang, Selangor\n\nMalay\n\nMade 2 March 2017\n\n[KDN.PQ.S. 600-16/15/20; PN(PU2)417/XVIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6794"] = {"id":"MY-H6794","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年印花税（豁免）（第3号）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2019","orig":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 3) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Miễn trừ) (số 3) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)82-2019_STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6794-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)     Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem\n(Pengecualian) (No. 3) 2019.\n\n (2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2019.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H6794-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1)  Tertakluk kepada subperenggan (2),  (3) dan (4), semua surat cara pindah\nmilik bagi pembelian harta kediaman di bawah  Kempen Pemilikan Rumah Kebangsaan\n2019, yang bernilai lebih  daripada tiga ratus ribu ringgit tetapi tidak lebih daripada\ndua juta lima ratus ribu  ringgit, yang disempurnakan oleh seseorang individu hendaklah\ndikecualikan daripada duti setem berkenaan dengan satu juta ringgit dan ke bawah  nilai\nharta kediaman itu.\n\n (2)  Pengecualian duti setem  di bawah subp erenggan (1) hendaklah hanya\nterpakai sekiranya  ̶\n\n(a) perjanjian jual beli bagi pembelian harta kediaman  itu\ndisempurnakan pada atau selepas 1 Januari 2019 tetapi tidak lewat\ndaripada 30 Jun 2019 dan disetemkan di mana -mana cawangan\nLembaga Hasil Dalam Negeri Malaysia;\n\n(b) perjanjian jual beli bagi pembelian harta k ediaman itu adalah\nantara seseorang individu dengan suatu pemaju perumahan ; dan\n\n(c) harga belian dalam perjanjian jual beli itu ialah suatu harga selepas\nsuatu diskaun sebanyak sepuluh peratus oleh pemaju perumahan\nitu kecuali bagi suatu harta kediaman yang t ertakluk kepada harga\nterkawal.\n\n (3)  Bagi maksud subperenggan (1)  ̶\n\n(a) nilai harta kediaman itu hendaklah berdasarkan nilai pasaran; dan\n\n(b) duti setem sebanyak tiga ringgit  dikenakan bagi setiap\nseratus ringgit ke atas amaun baki nilai harta kediaman yang\nmelebihi satu juta ringgit.\n\n (4)  Permohonan bagi p engecualian duti setem  di bawah subperenggan (1)\nhendaklah disertakan dengan suatu Perakuan Kempen Pemilikan Rumah  Kebangsaan\n2019 yang dikeluarkan oleh  Persatuan Pemaju Hartanah dan Perumahan Malaysia\n(REHDA), Persatuan Pemaju Perumahan dan Hartanah Sabah (SHAREDA) atau Persatuan\nPemaju Perumahan dan Harta Tanah Sarawak (SHEDA).\n\n (5)  Dalam perenggan ini—\n\n  \"harta kediaman\" ertinya suatu rumah, suatu unit kondominium, suatu\npangsapuri atau suatu rumah pangsa , yang dibeli atau diperoleh semata -mata\nuntuk digunakan sebagai suatu rumah kediaman, dan termasuk suatu pangsapuri\nperkhidmatan yang berhubungan dengannya pemaju perumahan itu mendapat\nkelulusan Lesen Pemaju  Perumahan dan Permit Iklan dan Jualan di bawah\nAkta Pemajuan Perumahan (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 1966 [ Akta 118], Enakmen\nPemajuan Perumahan (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 1978 , Sabah [No. 24 of 1978] atau\nOrdinan Pemajuan Perumahan (Kawalan dan Pelesenan) 2013 Sarawak [Cap. 69];\n\n  \"individu\" ertinya seora ng pembeli yang merupakan seorang warganegara\nMalaysia atau pembeli bersama yang merupakan warganegara Malaysia; dan\n\n  \"pemaju perumahan\" ertinya pemaju perumahan  yang berdaftar dengan\nPersatuan Pe maju Harta nah dan Perumahan Malaysia (REHDA), Persatuan\nPemaju Perumahan dan Harta nah Sabah (SHARED A) atau Persatuan Pemaju\nPerumahan dan Harta Tanah Sarawak (SHEDA).\n\nDibuat 15 Mac 2019\n[Perb. CR. (8.09)248/39/7-217 Jld. 13; PN(PU2)159/XXXIII]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nSTAMP ACT 1949\n\nSTAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the pow ers conf erred by subsection 80(1 ) of the\nStamp Act 1949 [Act 378], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6795"] = {"id":"MY-H6795","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年消费税（违法行为罚款了结）条例","en":"EXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"EXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Eksais (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Xử lý vi phạm bằng phạt tiền) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับสรรพสามิต (การระงับข้อหาด้วยค่าปรับ) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Cukai (Penyelesaian Pelanggaran dengan Denda) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2020_P.U.(A)82-2020_EXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6795-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan Eksais\n\n(Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2020.\n\nKesalahan yang boleh dikompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6795-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Kesalahan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Pertama ditetapkan sebagai\n\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun.\n\n(2) Kesalahan yang boleh dikompaun itu boleh dikompaun dengan keizinan\n\nbertulis Pendakwa Raya dalam Borang 1 Jadual Kedua.\n\nTawaran dan penyetujuterimaan kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6795-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan yang boleh\n\ndikompaun hendaklah dibuat dalam Borang 2 Jadual Kedua.\n\n(2) Seseorang yang menyetuju terima suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun\n\nsuatu kesalahan yang boleh dikompaun hendaklah menyetuju terima tawaran itu dalam\n\nBorang 3 Jadual Kedua.\n\nCara mengkompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6795-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Apabila menerima maklumat atau aduan bahawa suatu kesalahan yang\n\nboleh dikompaun telah dilakukan, mana-mana pegawai kanan eksais boleh, dengan\n\nkeizinan bertulis Pendakwa Raya, mengeluarkan tawaran untuk mengkompaun\n\nkesalahan itu dalam Borang 2 Jadual Kedua.\n\n(2) Suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan adalah bagi tempoh\n\nempat belas hari atau apa-apa tempoh lanjutan masa sebagaimana yang diberikan oleh\n\nKetua Pengarah, dan jika pembayaran penuh bagi jumlah yang ditawarkan itu dibuat\n\npada atau sebelum habis tempoh empat belas hari atau apa-apa tempoh lanjutan masa\n\nsebagaimana yang diberikan oleh Ketua Pengarah itu, tiada prosiding selanjutnya boleh\n\ndiambil terhadap orang yang telah melakukan kesalahan itu.\n\n(3) Jika tiada pembayaran bagi kompaun yang ditawarkan itu dibuat dalam\n\ntempoh yang dinyatakan dalam subperaturan (2), pendakwaan boleh dimulakan tanpa\n\nnotis selanjutnya.\n\nPembayaran kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6795-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Jika suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan disetuju terima\n\noleh orang yang kepadanya tawaran itu dibuat, dia hendaklah membayar kompaun itu\n\nsecara tunai atau draf bank dipalang dengan perkataan \"Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang\n\nkena dibayar kepada Ketua Pengarah.\n\n(2) Ketua Pengarah hendaklah mengeluarkan suatu resit rasmi untuk\n\ntiap-tiap pembayaran yang diterima di bawah subperaturan (1) kepada orang yang\n\nkepadanya tawaran untuk mengkompaun itu telah dibuat.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[Subperaturan 2(1)]\n\nKESALAHAN YANG BOLEH DIKOMPAUN\n\nKesalahan yang berikut ditetapkan sebagai kesalahan yang boleh dikompaun:\n\n(a) kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Akta Eksais 1976 seperti yang berikut:\n\nsubseksyen 20(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 21(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 21(2) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 23(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 23A(2A)\n\nsubseksyen 23B(2A)\n\nseksyen 26 dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 27 dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 28 dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 32(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 33(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 34(2) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 36 dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 37(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 38 dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 40B(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 40B(3) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 40D(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 40D(2) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 41B\n\nseksyen 41C dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 41D dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nsubseksyen 42A(1) dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 42B dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nseksyen 71\n\nseksyen 74\n\nseksyen 74A\n\nseksyen 74B\n\nseksyen 74C\n\nseksyen 75\n\nseksyen 76\n\n(b) kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Eksais 1977\n\n[P.U. (A) 161/1977] dibaca bersama seksyen 79 Akta Eksais 1976 seperti\n\nyang berikut:\n\nperaturan 7\n\nperaturan 8\n\nsubperaturan 12(1)\n\nsubperaturan 12(2)\n\nperaturan 13\n\nperaturan 14\n\nperaturan 16\n\nperaturan 18\n\nsubperaturan 19(1)\n\nperaturan 21\n\nperaturan 22\n\nperaturan 24\n\nperaturan 27\n\nperaturan 28\n\nsubperaturan 29(1)\n\nsubperaturan 29A(1)\n\nsubperaturan 31(1)\n\nsubperaturan 32(1)\n\nperaturan 33\n\nperaturan 34\n\nperaturan 35\n\nperaturan 38\n\nperaturan 42\n\nperaturan 45\n\nperaturan 46\n\nperaturan 47\n\nsubperaturan 59D(1)\n\nsubperaturan 59D(2)\n\nperaturan 59E\n\nperaturan 59F\n\nperaturan 59G\n\nperaturan 59I\n\nperaturan 59J\n\nperaturan 59K\n\nperaturan 59M\n\nperaturan 59R\n\n(c) kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Eksais (Penjualan\n\nLiquor yang Memabukkan) 1977 [P.U. (A) 156/1977] dibaca bersama seksyen 79\n\nAkta Eksais 1976 seperti yang berikut:\n\nperaturan 5\n\nperaturan 6\n\nperaturan 7\n\nperaturan 8\n\nperaturan 13\n\nperaturan 15\n\nperaturan 16\n\nperaturan 17\n\n(d) kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Eksais (Membotol dan\n\nMemindah Liquor yang Memabukkan) 1977 [P.U.(A) 158/1977] dibaca bersama\n\nseksyen 79 Akta Eksais 1976 seperti yang berikut:\n\nperaturan 4\n\nperaturan 5\n\n(e) kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Eksais (Kawalan Todi\n\ndan Kedai Todi) 1977 [P.U.(A) 157/1977] dibaca bersama peraturan 22 seperti\n\nyang berikut:\n\nperenggan 7(b)\n\nperenggan 9(e)\n\nperenggan 10(a)\n\nperenggan 11(a)\n\nperaturan 12\n\nperaturan 13\n\nperaturan 14\n\nperaturan 15\n\nperaturan 16\n\nperaturan 17\n\nperaturan 18\n\nperaturan 19\n\nperaturan 20\n\n(f) kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah perenggan (a) dibaca bersama\n\nseksyen 80 Akta Eksais 1976.\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Subperaturan 2(2), 3(1), 3(2) dan 4(1)]\n\nBORANG 1\n\n[Subperaturan 2(2)]\n\nAKTA EKSAIS 1976\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN EKSAIS (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2020\n\nKEIZINAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nPADA menjalankan kuasa yang diberikan oleh subseksyen 69(1) Akta Eksais 1976\n\n[Akta 176] dan subseksyen 376(3) Kanun Tatacara Jenayah [Akta 593],\n\nsaya ……………………………………………..…………… (nama) ……………………………………..……………\n\ndengan ini memberikan keizinan untuk mengkompaun ……………………………………………..…\n\n(nama orang yang kepadanya tawaran kompaun itu dibuat) ……………………………………..\n\nbagi kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah ……………………………………………..………………………\n\nyang dikatakan telah dilakukan pada …………………. (tarikh) …………………… di ………………\n\n(tempat) ………………………… .\n\nTarikh:\n\n………………………………………………\n\nPendakwa Raya/\n\nTimbalan Pendakwa Raya\n\nBORANG 2\n\n[Subperaturan 3(1) dan 4(1)]\n\nAKTA EKSAIS 1976\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN EKSAIS (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2020\n\nTAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nNombor rujukan : …………………………………………….\n\nTarikh : …………………………………………….\n\nJabatan Kastam Diraja Malaysia\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\nKepada:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSuatu penyiasatan telah dijalankan terhadap anda …………………………………………………….\n\n (nyatakan nama *syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain, jika ada)\n\ndan anda didapati telah melakukan kesalahan di bawah Akta Eksais 1976\n\n[Akta 176]/peraturan-peraturan yang dibuat di bawah Akta itu sebagaimana butir-butir\n\nyang berikut:\n\n(a) peruntukan *Akta/peraturan-peraturan yang berkaitan:\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……...\n\n(b) tarikh : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(c) masa : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(d) tempat : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(e) butir-butir kesalahan:\n\n………………….……………………………………………...……........................................................................\n\n2. Menurut subseksyen 69(1) Akta Eksais 1976, dengan keizinan bertulis\n\nPendakwa Raya, anda ditawarkan suatu kompaun bagi kesalahan yang dinyatakan\n\ndi atas bagi jumlah wang sebanyak RM …………………… (………..…………………ringgit sahaja).\n\n3. Sekiranya tawaran kompaun diterima, bayaran hendaklah dibuat secara\n\n*tunai/draf bank dipalang dengan perkataan \"Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena\n\ndibayar kepada Ketua Pengarah Kastam dan Eksais dan dihantar secara serahan tangan\n\nke Pejabat Kastam yang berkenaan.\n\n4. Suatu resit rasmi akan dikeluarkan apabila pembayaran kompaun itu diterima.\n\n5. Tawaran untuk mengkompaun ini adalah sah sehingga ….………………………………… .\n\n6. Jika tiada bayaran diterima dalam tempoh yang disebut dalam perenggan 5,\n\npendakwaan bagi kesalahan itu boleh dimulakan terhadap anda tanpa notis selanjutnya.\n\nSekian, terima kasih.\n\n\"SAYA YANG MENJALANKAN AMANAH\"\n\nKetua Pengarah Kastam dan Eksais\n\nJabatan Kastam Diraja Malaysia\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\nBORANG 3\n\n[Subperaturan 3(2)]\n\nAKTA EKSAIS 1976\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN EKSAIS (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2020\n\nPENYETUJUTERIMAAN TAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nKepada:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSaya merujuk kepada Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan dengan nombor\n\nrujukan ……………………………………………. bertarikh ……………………………………………. .\n\n2. Saya mengaku bahawa saya telah melakukan kesalahan ini dan saya menerima\n\ntawaran kompaun itu dan disertakan bersama dengan ini pembayaran secara *tunai/\n\ndraf bank dipalang dengan perkataan \"Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena dibayar\n\nkepada Ketua Pengarah Kastam dan Eksais bagi jumlah wang sebanyak\n\nRM …..………………………………………. (………………………………………………… ringgit sahaja)\n\nsebagai penyelesaian penuh bagi jumlah wang yang dinyatakan dalam perenggan 2\n\nTawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan.\n\nTandatangan : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\nNama (huruf besar) : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\n*No. Kad Pengenalan/No. Pasport : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\nUntuk dan bagi pihak (jika berkenaan) : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\n (nama *syarikat/perniagaan)\n\nCop rasmi *syarikat/perniagaan (jika berkenaan):\n\n..………………………….……………………....………………………\n\nAlamat:\n\n..………………………….……………………....………………………………....……………………………………….…\n\n…..………………………….……………………....………………………………....……………………………………….\n\nTarikh: ..……………………….\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\nDibuat 21 Februari 2020\n\n[SULIT KE.HD(122)860/01 Klt.4(4); PN(PU2)337/XXV]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\n\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nDiluluskan 27 Februari 2020\n\n[SULIT KE.HD(122)860/01 Klt.4(4); PN(PU2)337/XXV]\n\nTAN SRI TOMMY THOMAS\n\nPendakwa Raya Malaysia\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(1) of\n\nthe Excise Act 1976 [Act 176], the Minister, with the approval of the Public Prosecutor,\n\nmakes the following regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Excise (Compounding of Offences)\n\nRegulations 2020.\n\nCompoundable offences\n\n2. (1) The offences specified in the First Schedule are prescribed to be\n\ncompoundable offences.\n\n(2) The compoundable offences may be compounded with the written\n\nconsent of the Public Prosecutor in Form 1 of the Second Schedule.\n\nOffer and acceptance of compound\n\n3. (1) An offer to compound a compoundable offence shall be made in Form 2 of\n\nthe Second Schedule.\n\n(2) A person who accepts an offer to compound a compoundable offence shall\n\naccept the offer in Form 3 of the Second Schedule.\n\nMethod of compounding\n\n4. (1) Upon receipt of information or complaint that a compoundable offence\n\nhas been committed, any senior officer of excise may, with the written consent of\n\nthe Public Prosecutor, issue an offer to compound the offence in Form 2 of\n\nthe Second Schedule.\n\n(2) An offer to compound an offence is for a period of fourteen days or such\n\nextended time as the Director General may grant, and if full payment of the sum offered\n\nis made on or before the expiry of fourteen days or such extended time as\n\nthe Director General may grant, no further proceedings shall be taken against\n\nthe person who committed such offence.\n\n(3) If no payment of the compound offered is made within the period\n\nspecified in subregulation (2), prosecution may be instituted without further notice.\n\nPayment of compound\n\n5. (1) If an offer to compound an offence is accepted by the person to whom\n\nthe offer is made, he shall pay the compound by cash or bank draft crossed with\n\nthe words \"Account Payee Only\" made payable to the Director General.\n\n(2) The Director General shall issue an official receipt for every payment\n\nreceived under subregulation (1) to the person to whom the offer to compound is made.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulation 2(1)]\n\nCOMPOUNDABLE OFFENCES\n\nThe following offences are prescribed as compoundable offences:\n\n(a) offences committed under the Excise Act 1976 as follows:\n\nsubsection 20(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 21(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 21(2) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 23(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 23A(2A)\n\nsubsection 23B(2A)\n\nsection 26 read together with section 79\n\nsection 27 read together with section 79\n\nsection 28 read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 32(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 33(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 34(2) read together with section 79\n\nsection 36 read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 37(1) read together with section 79\n\nsection 38 read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 40B(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 40B(3) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 40D(1) read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 40D(2) read together with section 79\n\nsection 41B\n\nsection 41C read together with section 79\n\nsection 41D read together with section 79\n\nsubsection 42A(1) read together with section 79\n\nsection 42B read together with section 79\n\nsection 71\n\nsection 74\n\nsection 74A\n\nsection 74B\n\nsection 74C\n\nsection 75\n\nsection 76\n\n(b) offences committed under the Excise Regulations 1977 [P.U. (A) 161/1977] read\n\ntogether with section 79 of the Excise Act 1976 as follows:\n\nregulation 7\n\nregulation 8\n\nsubregulation 12(1)\n\nsubregulation 12(2)\n\nregulation 13\n\nregulation 14\n\nregulation 16\n\nregulation 18\n\nsubregulation 19(1)\n\nregulation 21\n\nregulation 22\n\nregulation 24\n\nregulation 27\n\nregulation 28\n\nsubregulation 29(1)\n\nsubregulation 29A(1)\n\nsubregulation 31(1)\n\nsubregulation 32(1)\n\nregulation 33\n\nregulation 34\n\nregulation 35\n\nregulation 38\n\nregulation 42\n\nregulation 45\n\nregulation 46\n\nregulation 47\n\nsubregulation 59D(1)\n\nsubregulation 59D(2)\n\nregulation 59E\n\nregulation 59F\n\nregulation 59G\n\nregulation 59I\n\nregulation 59J\n\nregulation 59K\n\nregulation 59M\n\nregulation 59R\n\n(c) offences committed under the Excise (Sale of Intoxicating Liquors)\n\nRegulations 1977 [P.U. (A) 156/1977] read together with section 79\n\nof the Excise Act 1976 as follows:\n\nregulation 5\n\nregulation 6\n\nregulation 7\n\nregulation 8\n\nregulation 13\n\nregulation 15\n\nregulation 16\n\nregulation 17\n\n(d) offences committed under the Excise (Bottling and Movement of Intoxicating\n\nLiquors) Regulations 1977 [P.U. (A) 158/1977] read together with section 79\n\nof the Excise Act 1976 as follows:\n\nregulation 4\n\nregulation 5\n\n(e) offences committed under the Excise (Control of Toddy and Toddy Shops)\n\nRegulations 1977 [P.U. (A) 157/1977] read together with regulation 22\n\nas follows:\n\nparagraph 7(b)\n\nparagraph 9(e)\n\nparagraph 10(a)\n\nparagraph 11(a)\n\nregulation 12\n\nregulation 13\n\nregulation 14\n\nregulation 15\n\nregulation 16\n\nregulation 17\n\nregulation 18\n\nregulation 19\n\nregulation 20\n\n(f) offences committed under paragraph (a) read together with section 80\n\nof the Excise Act 1976.\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulations 2(2), 3(1), 3(2) and 4(1)]\n\nFORM 1\n\n[Subregulation 2(2)]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nCONSENT TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(1) of the Excise Act 1976\n\n[Act 176] and subsection 376(3) of the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593],\n\nI …………………………………………..…………. (name) …………………………………………..………….\n\ngive consent to compound ……………………………………………………. (name of the person to\n\nwhom the compound offer is made) ……………………………………………………. for the\n\noffence/offences committed under ………………………………………………………………………\n\nwhich is/are said to have been committed on ……………………… (date) ……………………… at\n\n…………………………………………..…………. (place) …………………………………………..……… .\n\nDate:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\nPublic Prosecutor/\n\nDeputy Public Prosecutor\n\nFORM 2\n\n[Subregulations 3(1) and 4(1)]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nOFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nReference number : …………………………………………….\n\nDate : …………………………………………….\n\nRoyal Malaysian Customs Department\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\nTo:\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nAn investigation has been conducted against you……………………………………………………….\n\n (state name of *company/business/other body, if any)\n\nand you are found to have committed the offence under the Excise Act 1976\n\n[Act 176]/regulations made under the Act with the following particulars:\n\n(a) relevant provision of the *Act/regulations:\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……...\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……...\n\n(b) date : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(c) time : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(d) place : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(e) particulars of offence:\n\n………………….……………………………………………...……......................................................................\n\n2. Pursuant to subsection 69(1) of the Excise Act 1976, with the written consent of\n\nthe Public Prosecutor, you are offered a compound for the offence/offences stated\n\nabove for the sum of RM …..……………………………. (…..………..………………………ringgit only).\n\n3. If the offer to compound is accepted, payment shall be made by *cash/bank draft\n\ncrossed with the words \"Account Payee Only\" made payable to the Director General of\n\nCustoms and Excise and sent by hand to the relevant Customs Office.\n\n4. An official receipt shall be issued on receipt of the payment of the compound.\n\n5. This offer to compound shall be valid until ….………………………………………………………..\n\n6. If no payment is received within the period referred to in paragraph 5, prosecution\n\nfor the offence may be instituted against you without further notice.\n\nThank you.\n\n\"SAYA YANG MENJALANKAN AMANAH\"\n\nDirector General of Customs and Excise\n\nRoyal Malaysian Customs Department\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nFORM 3\n\n[Subregulation 3(2)]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nACCEPTANCE OF OFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nTo:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nI refer to the Offer to Compound Offences bearing the reference number\n\n……...………………… dated ……...……………………… .\n\n2. I admit that I have committed this offence/these offences and I accept the offer to\n\ncompound and enclosed herewith is the payment by *cash/bank draft crossed with the\n\nwords \"Account Payee Only\" made payable to the Director General of Customs and\n\nExcise for the sum of RM …………………………………… (…….……………………....... ringgit only)\n\nas full settlement of the sum stipulated in paragraph 2 of the Offer to Compound\n\nOffences.\n\nSignature : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\nName (in capital letter) : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\n*Identification No./Passport No. : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\nFor and on behalf (if applicable) : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\n (name of *company/business)\n\nOfficial stamp of *company/business (if applicable):\n\n..………………………….……………………....………………………\n\nAddress:\n\n..………………………….……………………....………………………………....……………………………………….…\n\n…..………………………….……………………....………………………………....……………………………………….\n\nDate: ..……………………….\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nMade 21 February 2020\n\n[SULIT KE.HD(122)860/01 Klt.4(4); PN(PU2)337/XXV]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\n\nMinister of Finance\n\nApproved 27 February 2020\n\n[SULIT KE.HD(122)860/01 Klt.4(4); PN(PU2)337/XXV]\n\nTAN SRI TOMMY THOMAS\n\nPublic Prosecutor of Malaysia"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6796"] = {"id":"MY-H6796","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年雇员住房、住宿及设施最低标准（违法行为罚款了结）条例","en":"EMPLOYEES’ MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND AMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"EMPLOYEES’ MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND AMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2021","ms":"Peraturan Standard Minimum Perumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja (Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2021","vi":"Quy định về Tiêu chuẩn tối thiểu về nhà ở, chỗ ở và tiện nghi cho người lao động (Xử lý vi phạm bằng phạt tiền) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับมาตรฐานขั้นต่ำด้านที่อยู่อาศัย ที่พัก และสิ่งอำนวยความสะดวกของลูกจ้าง (การระงับข้อหาด้วยค่าปรับ) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Standar Minimum Perumahan, Tempat Tinggal dan Fasilitas bagi Pegawai (Penyelesaian Pelanggaran dengan Denda) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2021_P.U.(A)82-2021_EMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND AMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6796-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nStandard Minimum Perumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja\n\n(Pengkompaunan Kesalahan) 2021.\n\nKesalahan yang boleh dikompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6796-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Kesalahan yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual Pertama ditetapkan sebagai\n\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun.\n\n(2) Kesalahan yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) boleh dikompaun dengan\n\nkeizinan secara bertulis Pendakwa Raya dalam Borang 1 Jadual Kedua.\n\nTatacara mengkompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6796-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Apabila menerima apa-apa maklumat atau aduan bahawa suatu kesalahan\n\nyang boleh dikompaun telah dilakukan, Ketua Pengarah boleh mengeluarkan tawaran\n\nuntuk mengkompaun kesalahan itu dalam Borang 2 Jadual Kedua.\n\n(2) Suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan adalah sah bagi\n\ntempoh empat belas hari bermula dari tarikh tawaran itu diterima oleh orang yang\n\ntawaran itu dibuat atau apa-apa tempoh lanjutan yang boleh diberikan oleh\n\nKetua Pengarah dan jika pembayaran penuh bagi jumlah yang ditawarkan itu dibuat\n\npada atau sebelum habis tempoh empat belas hari atau apa-apa tempoh lanjutan yang\n\ndiberikan itu, tiada prosiding selanjutnya boleh diambil terhadap orang yang telah\n\nmelakukan kesalahan itu.\n\nPenyetujuterimaan kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6796-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Seseorang yang menyetuju terima suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu\n\nkesalahan yang boleh dikompaun hendaklah menyetuju terima tawaran itu dalam\n\nBorang 3 Jadual Kedua dan mengembalikan Borang 3 itu kepada Ketua Pengarah.\n\nPembayaran kompaun"}},{"id":"MY-H6796-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Jika suatu tawaran untuk mengkompaun suatu kesalahan disetuju terima\n\noleh orang yang kepadanya tawaran itu dibuat, dia hendaklah membayar\n\nkompaun itu—\n\n(a) secara wang pos, perintah juruwang, arahan bank atau draf bank\n\ndipalang dengan perkataan \"Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena\n\ndibayar kepada Ketua Pengarah; atau\n\n(b) melalui pemindahan wang secara elektronik ke akaun yang ditentukan.\n\n(2) Ketua Pengarah hendaklah mengeluarkan suatu resit rasmi untuk tiap-tiap\n\npembayaran yang diterima di bawah subperaturan (1) kepada orang yang kepadanya\n\ntawaran untuk mengkompaun itu telah dibuat.\n\nPendakwaan boleh dimulakan jika tiada pembayaran dibuat"}},{"id":"MY-H6796-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Jika tiada pembayaran bagi kompaun yang ditawarkan itu dibuat dalam tempoh\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam subperaturan 3(2), pendakwaan boleh dimulakan tanpa\n\nnotis selanjutnya.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n[Subperaturan 2(1)]\n\nKESALAHAN YANG BOLEH DIKOMPAUN\n\nKesalahan yang berikut ditetapkan sebagai kesalahan yang boleh dikompaun:\n\n1. Semua kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Akta Standard Minimum Perumahan,\n\nPenginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja 1990\n\n2. Semua kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nStandard-Standard Minimum Perumahan dan Kemudahan Pekerja 1990\n\n[P.U. (A) 411/1990]\n\n3. Semua kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Standard\n\nMinimum Perumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja (Penginapan dan\n\nPenginapan Berpusat) 2020 [P.U. (A) 250/2020]\n\n4. Semua kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Standard\n\nMinimum Perumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja (Pusat Asuhan\n\nKanak-kanak) 1990 [P.U. (A) 413/1990]\n\n5. Semua kesalahan yang dilakukan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Standard\n\nMinimum Perumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja (Kadar Sewa Atau Caj\n\nMaksimum bagi Penginapan) 2020 [P.U. (A) 249/2020]\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Subperaturan 2(2) dan 3(1) dan peraturan 4]\n\nBORANG 1\n\n[Subperaturan 2(2)]\n\nAKTA STANDARD MINIMUM PERUMAHAN, PENGINAPAN DAN KEMUDAHAN\n\nPEKERJA 1990\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN STANDARD MINIMUM PERUMAHAN, PENGINAPAN DAN\n\nKEMUDAHAN PEKERJA (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2021\n\nKEIZINAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nPADA menjalankan kuasa yang diberikan oleh subseksyen 28A(2) Akta Standard\n\nMinimum Perumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja 1990 [Akta 446] dan\n\nsubseksyen 376(3) Kanun Tatacara Jenayah [Akta 593], saya\n\n…………………….......................................................... (nama) dengan ini memberikan keizinan\n\nuntuk mengkompaun ……………………………………………..………....................................................\n\n(nama orang yang kepadanya tawaran kompaun itu dibuat) bagi kesalahan yang dilakukan\n\ndi bawah ……………………………………………………..................... yang dikatakan telah dilakukan\n\npada ……………….............(tarikh) di…………………………………………...........................................(tempat).\n\n Tarikh:\n\n .........………......………………………………………\n\n Pendakwa Raya/Timbalan Pendakwa Raya\n\nBORANG 2\n\n[Subperaturan 3(1)]\n\nAKTA STANDARD MINIMUM PERUMAHAN, PENGINAPAN DAN KEMUDAHAN\n\nPEKERJA 1990\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN STANDARD MINIMUM PERUMAHAN, PENGINAPAN DAN\n\nKEMUDAHAN PEKERJA (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2021\n\nTAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nNombor rujukan : …………………………………………….\n\nTarikh : …………………………………………….\n\nKetua Pengarah Tenaga Kerja\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\nKepada:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSuatu penyiasatan telah dijalankan terhadap anda\n\n……………………………………………………..............................................................................................................\n\n (nyatakan nama *individu/syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain)\n\ndan anda didapati telah melakukan kesalahan di bawah Akta Standard Minimum\n\nPerumahan, Penginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja 1990 [Akta 446]/peraturan-peraturan\n\nyang dibuat di bawah Akta itu sebagaimana butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n(a) peruntukan *Akta/peraturan-peraturan yang berkaitan:\n\n……………………………….…………………………………………………………….…….............................\n\n……………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……...\n\n(b) tarikh : ……………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(c) masa : ……………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(d) tempat : ……………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(e) butir-butir kesalahan:\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………...…….........................\n\n…………………………………………….……………………………………………...……................................\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………...…….........................\n\n2. Menurut subseksyen 28A(2) Akta Standard Minimum Perumahan,\n\nPenginapan dan Kemudahan Pekerja 1990 [Akta 446], dengan\n\nkeizinan bertulis Pendakwa Raya, anda ditawarkan suatu kompaun bagi kesalahan\n\nyang dinyatakan di atas bagi jumlah sebanyak\n\nRM………………………………....................................................................................................................................\n\n................................................................................. (dalam perkataan) ringgit sahaja).\n\n3. Sekiranya tawaran kompaun diterima, bayaran hendaklah dibuat—\n\n(a) secara *wang pos/perintah juruwang/arahan bank/draf bank dipalang\n\ndengan perkataan \"Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena dibayar kepada\n\nKetua Pengarah Tenaga Kerja dan dihantar secara serahan tangan atau\n\npos berdaftar ke alamat berikut:\n\n..........................................................................................................................................................\n\n..............................................................................................................................................; atau\n\n(b) melalui pemindahan wang secara elektronik ke akaun berikut:\n\n…………………………………………………………………………………………………..................\n\n4. Suatu resit rasmi akan dikeluarkan apabila pembayaran kompaun itu diterima.\n\n5. Tawaran untuk mengkompaun ini adalah sah\n\nsehingga….……………………………………............................................................................................................\n\n6. Jika tiada bayaran diterima dalam tempoh yang disebut dalam perenggan 5,\n\npendakwaan bagi kesalahan itu boleh dimulakan terhadap anda tanpa notis selanjutnya.\n\nKetua Pengarah Tenaga Kerja\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkenaan\n\nBORANG 3\n\n[Peraturan 4]\n\nAKTA STANDARD MINIMUM PERUMAHAN, PENGINAPAN DAN KEMUDAHAN\n\nPEKERJA 1990\n\nPERATURAN-PERATURAN STANDARD MINIMUM PERUMAHAN, PENGINAPAN DAN\n\nKEMUDAHAN PEKERJA (PENGKOMPAUNAN KESALAHAN) 2021\n\nPENYETUJUTERIMAAN TAWARAN UNTUK MENGKOMPAUN KESALAHAN\n\nKepada:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n*Tuan/Puan,\n\nSaya merujuk kepada Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan dengan nombor\n\nrujukan ……………………………………………. bertarikh ……………………………........................................\n\n2. Saya mengaku bahawa saya telah melakukan kesalahan ini dan saya menerima\n\ntawaran kompaun itu dan disertakan bersama dengan ini pembayaran secara\n\n*wang pos/perintah juruwang/arahan bank/draf bank dipalang dengan perkataan\n\n\"Akaun Penerima Sahaja\" yang kena dibayar kepada Ketua Pengarah Tenaga Kerja bagi\n\njumlah sebanyak RM………………………(……………..............................……................................................\n\n(dalam perkataan) ringgit sahaja) sebagai penyelesaian penuh bagi jumlah wang yang\n\ndinyatakan dalam perenggan 2 Tawaran untuk Mengkompaun Kesalahan.\n\nTandatangan : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\nNama (huruf besar) : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\n*No. Kad Pengenalan/No. Pasport : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\nUntuk dan bagi pihak (jika berkenaan) : .………………………………………..……………...……......\n\n (nama *syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain)\n\nCop rasmi *syarikat/perniagaan/badan lain (jika berkenaan):\n\n…....……………………………………………………………………………….......\n\nAlamat:\n\n..………………………….……………………....………………………………....……………………………………….…..\n\n.…..………………………….……………………....………………………………....………………………………………..\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\nTarikh: ..……………………….\n\n*Potong mana-mana yang tidak berkaitan\n\nDibuat 25 Februari 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/16/5; PN(PU2)376/III]\n\nDATUK SERI M. SARAVANAN\n\n Menteri Sumber Manusia\n\nDiluluskan 25 Februari 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/16/5; PN(PU2)376/III]\n\n TAN SRI IDRUS BIN HARUN\n\n Pendakwa Raya Malaysia\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS\n\nAND AMENITIES ACT 1990\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 28A(1) of the\n\nEmployees' Minimum Standards of Housing, Accommodations and Amenities Act 1990\n\n[Act 446], the Minister, with the approval of the Public Prosecutor, makes the\n\nfollowing regulations:\n\nCitation\n\n1. These regulations may be cited as the Employees' Minimum\n\nStandards of Housing, Accommodations and Amenities (Compounding of\n\nOffences) Regulations 2021.\n\nOffences which may be compounded\n\n2. (1) The offences specified in the First Schedule are prescribed as offences which\n\nmay be compounded.\n\n(2) The offences referred to in subregulation (1) may be compounded with the\n\nconsent in writing of the Public Prosecutor in Form 1 of the Second Schedule.\n\nProcedure for compounding\n\n3. (1) Upon receipt of any information or complaint that an offence which may be\n\ncompounded has been committed, the Director General may issue an offer to compound\n\nthe offence in Form 2 of the Second Schedule.\n\n(2) An offer to compound an offence shall be valid for a period of fourteen days\n\nstarting from the date the offer is received by the person whose offer is made or such\n\nextended period as the Director General may grant and if full payment of the sum\n\noffered is made on or before the expiry of fourteen days or such extended period\n\ngranted, no further proceedings shall be taken against the person who committed\n\nsuch offence.\n\nAcceptance of compound\n\n4. A person who accepts an offer to compound an offence which may be compounded\n\nshall accept the offer in Form 3 of the Second Schedule and return Form 3 to the\n\nDirector General.\n\nPayment of compound\n\n5. (1) If an offer to compound an offence is accepted by the person to whom the\n\noffer is made, he shall pay the compound—\n\n(a) by postal order, cashier's order, banker's order or bank draft crossed\n\nwith the words \"Account Payee Only\" made payable to the\n\nDirector General; or\n\n(b) through an electronic fund transfer to a designated account.\n\n(2) The Director General shall issue an official receipt for every payment\n\nreceived under subregulation (1) to the person to whom the offer to compound is made.\n\nProsecution may be instituted if no payment made\n\n6. If no payment of the compound offered is made within the period specified\n\nin subregulation 3(2), prosecution may be instituted without further notice.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulation 2(1)]\n\nOFFENCES WHICH MAY BE COMPOUNDED\n\nThe following offences are prescribed to be offences which may be compounded:\n\n1. All offences committed under the Employees' Minimum Standards of Housing,\n\nAccommodations and Amenities Act 1990\n\n2. All offences committed under the Worker's Minimum Standards of Housing and\n\nAmenities Regulations 1990 [P.U. (A) 411/1990]\n\n3. All offences committed under the Employees' Minimum Standards of Housing,\n\nAccommodations and Amenities (Accommodation and Centralized\n\nAccommodation) Regulations 2020 [P.U. (A) 250/2020]\n\n4. All offences committed under the Employees' Minimum Standards of Housing,\n\nAccommodations and Amenities (Nurseries) Regulations 1990 [P.U. (A) 413/1990]\n\n5. All offences committed under the Employees' Minimum Standards of Housing,\n\nAccommodations and Amenities (Maximum Rental or Charges for\n\nAccommodation) Regulations 2020 [P.U. (A) 249/2020]\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\n[Subregulations 2(2) and 3(1) and regulation 4]\n\nFORM 1\n\n[Subregulation 2(2)]\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES ACT 1990\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nCONSENT TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 28A(2) of the Employees' Minimum\n\nStandards of Housing, Accommodations and Amenities Act 1990 [Act 446] and\n\nsubsection 376(3) of the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593],\n\nI ………………………………………………………………………………….. (name) give consent to\n\ncompound …………………………………………………………………………………………………. (name of the\n\nperson to whom the compound offer is made) for the offence committed under\n\n………………………………………………………………. which is said to have been committed\n\non………………………. (date) at ………………………..……………………………………………………… (place).\n\nDate:\n\n ……………….....................................................\n\n Public Prosecutor/Deputy Public Prosecutor\n\nFORM 2\n\n[Subregulation 3(1)]\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES ACT 1990\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nOFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nReference number : …………………………………………….\n\nDate : …………………………………………….\n\nDirector General of Labour\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\nTo:\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n…………………………………………………………\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nAn investigation has been conducted against you………………………………………………………….\n\n (state name of *individual/company/business/other body)\n\nand you are found to have committed the offence under the Employees' Minimum\n\nStandards of Housing, Accommodations and Amenities Act 1990 [Act 446]/regulations\n\nmade under the Act with the following particulars:\n\n(a) relevant provision of the *Act/regulations:\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……….\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………………………….……\n\n(b) date : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...………\n\n(c) time : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……....\n\n(d) place : ………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……......\n\n(e) particulars of offence:\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……............................\n\n………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……............................\n\n........………………………………………………….……………………………………………...……....................\n\n2. Pursuant to subsection 28A(2) of the Employees' Minimum Standards of\n\nHousing, Accommodations and Amenities Act 1990 [Act 446], with the written consent\n\nof the Public Prosecutor, you are offered a compound for the offence stated above for\n\nthe sum of RM ……………………………………………(……………………………………………………………..\n\n(in words) ringgit only).\n\n3. If the offer to compound is accepted, payment shall be made—\n\n(a) by *postal order/cashier's order/banker's order/bank draft crossed with\n\nthe words \"Account Payee Only\" made payable to the Director General of\n\nLabour and sent by hand or registered post to the following address:\n\n..........................................................................................................................................................\n\n .....……………………………………………………………………………………………..............; or\n\n(b) through an electronic fund transfer to the following account:\n\n………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n4. An official receipt shall be issued on receipt of the payment of the compound.\n\n5. This offer to compound shall be valid until ….………………………………………………………..\n\n6. If no payment is received within the time referred to in paragraph 5, prosecution\n\nfor the offence may be instituted against you without further notice.\n\n Director General of Labour\n\n_____________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nFORM 3\n\n[Regulation 4]\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES ACT 1990\n\nEMPLOYEES' MINIMUM STANDARDS OF HOUSING, ACCOMMODATIONS AND\n\nAMENITIES (COMPOUNDING OF OFFENCES) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nACCEPTANCE OF OFFER TO COMPOUND OFFENCES\n\nTo:\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n…………………………………………….\n\n*Sir/Madam,\n\nI refer to the Offer to Compound Offences bearing the reference number\n\n……...………………………………………. dated ……...………………………………………………………………….\n\n2. I admit that I have committed this offence and I accept the offer to compound and\n\nenclosed herewith is the payment by *postal order/cashier's order/banker's\n\norder/bank draft crossed with the words \"Account Payee Only\" made payable to the\n\nDirector General of Labour for the sum of RM …………………………….\n\n(.………………………………………………….. (in words) ringgit only) as full settlement of the sum\n\nstipulated in paragraph 2 of the Offer to Compound Offences.\n\nSignature : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\nName (in capital letter) : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\n*Identification No./Passport No. : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\nFor and on behalf (if applicable) : .………………………………………..……………...………………......\n\n(name of *company/business/other body)\n\nOfficial stamp of *company/business/other body (if applicable):\n\n………....…………………………………………………………………………….\n\nAddress:\n\n..………………………….……………………....………………………………....……………………………………….…..\n\n.…..………………………….……………………....………………………………....………………………………………..\n\n.…………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………..\n\nDate: ..………………………………..\n\n*Delete whichever is inapplicable\n\nMade 25 February 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/16/5; PN(PU2)376/III]\n\n DATUK SERI M. SARAVANAN\n\n Minister of Human Resources\n\nApproved 25 February 2021\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/16/5; PN(PU2)376/III]\n\n TAN SRI IDRUS BIN HARUN\n\n Public Prosecutor of Malaysia"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6797"] = {"id":"MY-H6797","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":9,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年水务产业（许可）（修正）条例","en":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022","orig":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022","ms":"Peraturan Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Pelesenan) (Pindaan) 2022","vi":"Quy định về Ngành dịch vụ nước (Cấp phép) (Sửa đổi) năm 2022","th":"ข้อบังคับอุตสาหกรรมบริการน้ำ (การออกใบอนุญาต) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Peraturan Industri Jasa Air (Perizinan) (Perubahan) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 9 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2022_P.U.(A)82-2022_WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6797-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nIndustri Perkhidmatan Air (Pelesenan) (Pindaan) 2022.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 April 2022.\n\nPindaan peraturan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Pelesenan) 2007\n\n[P.U. (A) 432/2007], yang disebut \"Peraturan-Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan-Peraturan ini,\n\ndipinda dalam peraturan 2, dalam tafsiran \"pemegang syer asing\",\n\ndalam perenggan (c), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Akta Syarikat 1965 [Akta 125]\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"Akta Syarikat 2016 [Akta 777]\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan 4 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam perenggan (2)(g), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"seksyen 122A\n\nAkta Syarikat 1965\" dengan perkataan \"seksyen 197 Akta Syarikat 2016\";\n\ndan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perenggan (2)(i) dengan perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(i) akaun terkini yang telah diaudit, perlembagaan syarikat dan\n\nsalinan dokumen yang diperaku di bawah seksyen 17, 46, 58\n\ndan 78 Akta Syarikat 2016 yang telah difailkan oleh pemohon\n\ndengan Suruhanjaya Syarikat Malaysia; dan\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 7"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Peraturan 7 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (1) dengan subperaturan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(1) Sesuatu lesen individu yang diberikan adalah sah—\n\n(a) bagi suatu tempoh tidak melebihi sepuluh tahun dari\n\ntarikh pemberian atau pembaharuan lesen individu\n\nitu bagi permohonan yang dibuat di bawah\n\nperenggan 4(4)(a) atau perenggan 4(4)(b); atau\n\n(b) bagi suatu tempoh tidak melebihi lima tahun dari\n\ntarikh pemberian atau pembaharuan lesen individu\n\nitu bagi permohonan yang dibuat di bawah\n\nperenggan 4(4)(c) atau perenggan 4(4)(d).\";\n\n(b) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan memotong perkataan \"tiga tahun\"; dan\n\n(c) dalam subperaturan (3), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"tiga tahun\n\ntersebut\" dengan perkataan \"yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1)\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 12"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Peraturan 12 Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan—\n\n(a) dalam perenggan (1)(l), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"memindah milikkan\" dengan perkataan \"memindahmilikkan\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam perenggan (5)(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"memindahmilikan\" dengan perkataan \"memindahmilikkan\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 16"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Perenggan 16(g) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan, dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"memindah milikkan\" dengan perkataan \"memindahmilikkan\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Akta Syarikat 1965\" dengan perkataan\n\n\"Akta Syarikat 2016\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. Jadual Pertama kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam Borang A\n\nberhubung dengan kepala A. BUTIR-BUTIR PEMOHON PARTICULARS OF APPLICANT\n\ndengan menggantikan butiran 4 dan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya dengan\n\nbutiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n\"4. Butir-butir pegangan saham pemohon*\n\nParticulars of shareholding of the applicant*\n\nNama\n\nName\n\nNo. KPPN/\n\nNo. Pasport/\n\nNo. Syarikat/\n\nNRIC No./\n\nPassport No./\n\nCompany No.\n\nAlamat\n\nAddress\n\nNombor & % saham\n\nyang dipegang\n\nNumber and % of\n\nshare held\n\nLangsung\n\nDirect\n\nTidak\n\nIndirect\n\n* Sila nyatakan pemegang syer benefisial utama dan juga pemegang syer\n\n asing dan tempatan\n\n* Please indicate ultimate beneficial shareholder and also indicate foreign\n\n shareholders and local shareholders.\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Ketiga"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Jadual Ketiga kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam Borang B—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Menteri Tenaga, Air dan Komunikasi\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"Menteri Alam Sekitar dan Air\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Minister of Energy, Water and\n\nCommunications\" dengan perkataan \"Minister of Environment and Water\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Keempat"}},{"id":"MY-H6797-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Jadual Keempat kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dalam Borang C—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Menteri Tenaga, Air dan Komunikasi\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"Menteri Alam Sekitar dan Air\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Minister of Energy, Water and\n\nCommunications\" dengan perkataan \"Minister of Environment and Water\".\n\nDibuat 30 Mac 2022\n\n[KASA.BAP.(S).700-1/1/1 KLT.3; PN(PU2)660/Jld. 15]\n\nDATO' SRI TUAN IBHARIM BIN TUAN MAN\n\nMenteri Alam Sekitar dan Air\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY ACT 2006\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (LICENSING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 179 of the\n\nWater Services Industry Act 2006 [Act 655], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6798"] = {"id":"MY-H6798","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年水务产业（供水服务费率）（吉兰丹州）（修正）条例","en":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF KELANTAN) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2023","orig":"WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF KELANTAN) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2023","ms":"Peraturan Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Kadar Perkhidmatan Bekalan Air) (Negeri Kelantan) (Pindaan) 2023","vi":"Quy định về Ngành dịch vụ nước (Giá dịch vụ cấp nước) (Bang Kelantan) (Sửa đổi) năm 2023","th":"ข้อบังคับอุตสาหกรรมบริการน้ำ (อัตราค่าบริการจ่ายน้ำ) (รัฐกลันตัน) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Peraturan Industri Jasa Air (Tarif Layanan Penyediaan Air) (Negara Bagian Kelantan) (Perubahan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2023_P.U.(A)82-2023_WATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES) (STATE OF KELANTAN) (AMENDMENT) REGUL.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6798-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nIndustri Perkhidmatan Air (Kadar Perkhidmatan Bekalan Air) (Negeri Kelantan)\n\n(Pindaan) 2023.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 April 2023.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H6798-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Industri Perkhidmatan Air (Kadar Perkhidmatan\n\nBekalan Air) (Negeri Kelantan) 2010 [P.U. (A) 333/2010] dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama\n\ndengan menggantikan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengan \"Domestik (meter pukal)\"\n\ndengan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nJumlah penggunaan Kadar setiap\n\nmeter padu\n\n(RM)\n\nKadar minimum\n\n(setiap bulan)\n\n(RM)\n\n\"kadar rata 1.65 16.50\".\n\nDibuat 29 Mac 2023\n\n[NRECC: KASA.BAP.(S).700-1/1/1 KLT.7(17); PN(PU2)660/JLD. 17]\n\nNIK NAZMI BIN NIK AHMAD\n\nMenteri Sumber Asli, Alam Sekitar\n\ndan Perubahan Iklim\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY ACT 2006\n\nWATER SERVICES INDUSTRY (RATES FOR WATER SUPPLY SERVICES)\n\n(STATE OF KELANTAN) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraphs 84(2)(a) and 179(i)\n\nof the Water Services Industry Act 2006 [Act 655], the Minister, on the recommendation\n\nof the Commission, makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H6799"] = {"id":"MY-H6799","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 82/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年全国限速（修正）令","en":"NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn tốc độ quốc gia (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งจำกัดความเร็วแห่งชาติ (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Batas Kecepatan Nasional (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA82","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2024_P.U.(A)82-2024_NATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6799-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan\n\n(Pindaan) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 11 Mac 2024.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H6799-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Kebangsaan 1989 [P.U. (A) 18/1989] dipinda dalam Jadual,\n\ndalam butiran 19—\n\n(a) dalam subbutiran (b), dengan memotong perkataan \"dan\" di hujung\n\nsubbutiran itu;\n\n(b) dalam subbutiran (c), dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung subbutiran\n\nitu dengan perkataan \"; dan\";\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran (c) subbutiran yang berikut:\n\n\"(d) kilometer 242.70 di koordinat U 498677.665, T 311856.900\n\nGrid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000) dan berakhir di kilometer 277.67\n\ndi Persimpangan Bertingkat Taiping Selatan di koordinat\n\nU 529398.559, T 303373.677 Grid RSO Geosentrik (GDM 2000)\n\narah utara dan arah selatan.\"; dan\n\n(d) dengan memasukkan selepas PETA 3: PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT\n\nBANDAR BUKIT RAJA UTARA KE PERSIMPANGAN ASSAM JAWA\n\npeta yang berikut:\n\n\"PETA 4: PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT BERUAS KE PERSIMPANGAN BERTINGKAT\n\nTAIPING SELATAN\n\nDibuat 6 Mac 2024\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/20 Jld.2; PN(PU2)460/JLD.131]\n\n LOKE SIEW FOOK\n\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\n\".\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nNATIONAL SPEED LIMIT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 69(1)\n\nof the Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
  FT["MY-H680"] = {"id":"MY-H680","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 100/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":9,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（有条件行动管制）（第4号）（修正）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2021","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (Kiểm soát di chuyển có điều kiện) (số 4) (Sửa đổi) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (การควบคุมการเคลื่อนย้ายแบบมีเงื่อนไข) (ฉบับที่ 4) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Pengendalian Mobilitas Bersyarat) (Nomor 4) (Perubahan) Tahun 2021","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Kawalan Pergerakan Bersyarat) (Bilangan 4) (Pindaan) 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA100","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 9 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)100-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITION.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H680-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Negeri Johor 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Negeri Kedah kecuali Daerah Langkawi 10.3.2021 – 18.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. Negeri Kelantan 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n(1)\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan/Bahagian/Daerah\n\n(2)\n\nTempoh"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"en":"4. Negeri Sembilan 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"en":"5. Negeri Pulau Pinang 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"en":"6. Negeri Perak 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"en":"7. Negeri Sarawak 2.3.2021 – 15.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"en":"8. Negeri Selangor 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021"}},{"id":"MY-H680-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"en":"9. Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\nDibuat 10 Mac 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS)\n\n(CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) (NO. 4) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas)\n\n(Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) (Amendment) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 10 March 2021.\n\nSubstitution of First Schedule\n\n2. The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (Conditional Movement Control) (No. 4) Regulations 2021\n\n[P.U. (A) 97/2021] are amended by substituting for the First Schedule\n\nthe following schedule:\n\n\"FIRST SCHEDULE\n\nAPPLICATION\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n1. State of Johore 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n2. State of Kedah except Langkawi District 10.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n3. State of Kelantan 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n4. State of Negeri Sembilan 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n(1)\n\nInfected Local Area/Division/District\n\n(2)\n\nPeriod\n\n5. State of Penang 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n6. State of Perak 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n7. State of Sarawak 2.3.2021 – 15.3.2021\n\n8. State of Selangor 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\n9. Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur 5.3.2021 – 18.3.2021\n\nMade 10 March 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/Jld. 5]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-15"};
